  "instructions": [
    "Soak noodles in very hot tap water",
    "While noodles are soaking , cut chicken into thin julienne strips",
    "Heat oil in deep skillet over medium-high heat",
    "Add chicken",
    "Garlic , ginger , and pepper flakes",
    "Cook , stirring for 1 minute",
    "Then add broth and fish sauce and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce heat to medium and simmer until chicken is done , about 8 minutes",
    "Drain noodles and cut into short pieces , about 1-1 1 / 2 inches long",
    "Arrange noodles in bottom of bowls",
    "Ladle soup over the top and sprinkle with cilantro , onion , and basil",
    "Serve with\"tuong ot sriracha\" , or chile paste , if desired"
  ],
